00:57:57.200 --> 00:58:32.240
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]

00:58:32.240 --> 00:58:38.420
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who is worrying about the effects of this radio show.

00:58:38.420 --> 00:58:42.740
<v Torey Malatia>It's very harmful. And it's like a yodel out to the immigrants.

00:58:42.740 --> 00:58:47.130
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week for more stories of This American Life .

00:58:47.130 --> 00:58:55.680
<v Torey Malatia>It's saying, are you out there? Is there anyone out there? Would you like to come to America?

00:58:55.680 --> 00:59:00.680
